View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, but.........Demon can't grant Exigent exaltation to people....</div> </div> </div> </div>You may get something close with black market Exigents created by Forbidden Gods. <br /> <br /> Or Niobrarans. <br /> <br /> Or, like, that one god who is the heavenly representative to the Demon City. That guy is probably a little disturbed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T21:00:34-08:00","id":322391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/314454-lunar-is-moon-exalted-_-i-thought-they-are-animal-exalted?p=322388#post322388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You may get something close with black market Exigents created by Forbidden Gods.<br /> <br /> Or Niobrarans.<br /> <br /> Or, like, that one god who is the heavenly representative to the Demon City. That guy is probably a little disturbed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hatewheel had said that &quot;Demons are unable to process the Exigence, the Unconquered Sun made sure of it&quot;. So no black market Exigent for me :sadface:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Kimberian Exalted away! If Oramus and Isidoros think that they're the only ones willing to dare diminishment, they have another thing coming! </div> </div> </div>Having Kimbery as the patron would just be nightmarish, you never know whether she is in her &quot;TsunTsun&quot; or &quot;DereDere&quot; mode.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T21:25:49-08:00","id":322398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/314454-lunar-is-moon-exalted-_-i-thought-they-are-animal-exalted?p=322391#post322391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having Kimbery as the patron would just be nightmarish, you never know whether she is in her &quot;TsunTsun&quot; or &quot;DereDere&quot; mode.</div> </div> </div> </div>You want illusions and such, you have to make sure to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XOILKHmZBwc\" target=\"_blank\">never use wire hangers.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T21:40:48-08:00","id":322405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/314454-lunar-is-moon-exalted-_-i-thought-they-are-animal-exalted?p=322391#post322391\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hatewheel had said that &quot;Demons are unable to process the Exigence, the Unconquered Sun made sure of it&quot;. So no black market Exigent for me :sadface:<br /> <br /> Having Kimbery as the patron would just be nightmarish, you never know whether she is in her &quot;TsunTsun&quot; or &quot;DereDere&quot; mode.</div> </div> </div> </div>According to the devs, EX3 is meant to be very friendly to introducing homebrewed Exalts, whether or not they're Exigents. The Chosen of the Scarlet Moon sound like he/she/they'd be pretty freaking awesome. That the Exigence doesn't work for demons just means finding some other rationale for Ululaya's ability to Exalt mortals; don't let it stand in the way of a kickass splat.<br /> <br /> * Hell, I'll give it a whirl. I don't even care that the bulk of the explanation's maybe a little hacky.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Autochthon indeed told his siblings the secret to create Exalted of their own, and explained in truth the unavoidable Law of Diminishment. Since Isidoros and Oramus, none among the Yozis dared to act on this knowledge. Until one day. Ululaya, ever the favored child and soul of Kimbery since time immemorial, earned the Great Mother's bitter hatred and reproach. Whatever the Lady of a Thousand Faces did to earn this ire is a rare secret indeed, but it drove the Yozi to give her child the key knowledge to Exaltation -- without hint of the price.<br /> <br /> It is said Ululaya was once far mightier, and that her scarlet robes shone near bright as day; Ligier himself once allowed that the Scarlet Moon nearly approached his own brilliance in all ways. Since that time, he has more than thrice regarded the much dimmer moon of hell with a wistful look that might be pity or might be scorn. Those who wonder at how Kimbery might so grievously wound her own fetich -- and thus herself -- know nothing of the Sea that Marched Against the Flame: she fills every ocean in Malfeas's every layer, and every drop of her is spite.<br /> <br /> Still, the Yozi found no joy in her daughter's maiming. Even lessened, Ululaya's nature is give and take, willingly or no, and so she abides it all with aplomb. Providence given, a secret taken. Puissance given, champions taken. Injury taken, and oh, what delightful vengeance the Empress of the Blood-Drenched Tide and her Chosen shall give.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}